This licence covers the code of the game written for it (the Chess module, the
tools, the tests and the scripts) and its own art (assets/artgen/,
assets/atlases/). The BagiEngine in the engine/ folder is a git submodule with its own LICENSE
(Beerware too); the libraries, fonts and other files of other authors that the
engine or this repository carries keep their own licences: THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
of the game and engine/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md list them, and a game that ships
them must carry their notices. Stockfish, the chess program the game can start
when a person has installed it, is not part of this repository and keeps its own
licence (GPL-3.0): see THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.
